  "content": "<p>The main visual part of this project is finished. It started during a lab reorganization: old components that still work but disappear forever once they go back in the box. So we put them on the wall instead — breadboards, opened devices, circuit boards on display for everyone to see and take if useful.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/electronicwaste\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>electronicwaste</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/repairculture\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>repairculture</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/pcbart\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>pcbart</span></a></p>",
